# Real Hermes 0.22.5 (CLI on PATH), local-directory backend, no network.
# Homes: <work>/roam-homes/sess-a (device proof-a), sess-b (proof-b),
# sess-c (proof-c), sess-d (proof-d); stores sess-store / sess-store2.
# Sessions were created with Hermes's own `hermes sessions import` from
# small synthetic Claude Code JSONL fixtures. The imported conversation rows
# are end-stamped directly in the fixture homes (the same `cli_close` stamp a
