# owned in-process, and the md bulk export only ever matches ended sessions,
# so a network-free fixture needs that one completion stamp. Everything
# else — plugin install, push, pull, listing, printing, status — ran for
# real. Archive key values are redacted. Exit code: 0 (every check passed).
#
# Verdict lines: 'verified:' marks an assertion that passed.


